WEBVTT

00:00:26.261 --> 00:00:27.763
Yes?

00:00:35.103 --> 00:00:37.332
-Nothing.
-That's right.

00:00:39.399 --> 00:00:42.282
Because you know, deep down...

00:00:43.528 --> 00:00:45.114
...you deserve to be punished.

00:00:46.782 --> 00:00:48.081
Don't you, Mr. Potter?

00:00:53.163 --> 00:00:54.790
Go on.

00:01:03.799 --> 00:01:06.183
- Skiving Snackboxes.
- Sweets that make you ill.

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.886
Get out of class whenever you like.

00:01:08.053 --> 00:01:10.807
Obtain hours of pleasure
from unprofitable boredom.

00:01:12.808 --> 00:01:14.142
Care for another?

00:01:14.309 --> 00:01:16.228
I'm not asking you
to write all of it for me.

00:01:16.395 --> 00:01:17.437
Oh, please.

00:01:17.604 --> 00:01:19.982
I've been busy studying
for these stupid OWL exams.

00:01:20.482 --> 00:01:22.276
I'll do the introduction. That's all.

00:01:22.442 --> 00:01:25.666
Hermione, you're honestly
the most wonderful person I've ever met.

00:01:26.363 --> 00:01:29.647
-And if I'm ever rude to you again....
-I'll know you've gone back to normal.

00:01:35.664 --> 00:01:37.749
What's wrong with your hand?

00:01:38.292 --> 00:01:39.751
Nothing.

00:01:41.003 --> 00:01:42.421
The other hand.

00:01:45.424 --> 00:01:46.789
-You've got to tell Dumbledore.
-No.

00:01:47.426 --> 00:01:48.946
Dumbledore's got enough
on his mind right now.

00:01:49.803 --> 00:01:51.520
I don't want to give
Umbridge the satisfaction.

00:01:52.097 --> 00:01:53.986
Bloody hell, Harry.
The woman's torturing you.

00:01:54.683 --> 00:01:57.835
-If the parents knew about this....
-I haven't got any of those, have I, Ron?

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:03.140
Harry, you've got to report this.

00:02:04.067 --> 00:02:06.672
-It's perfectly simple. You're being--
-No, it's not.

00:02:07.779 --> 00:02:09.825
Hermione, whatever this is,
it's not simple.

00:02:11.658 --> 00:02:12.892
You don't understand.

00:02:16.288 --> 00:02:18.206
Then help us to.

00:02:32.929 --> 00:02:34.486
Dear Padfoot...

00:02:35.349 --> 00:02:36.579
...I hope you're all right.

00:02:37.225 --> 00:02:40.925
It's starting to get colder here.
Winter is definitely on the way.

00:02:44.483 --> 00:02:48.077
In spite of being back at Hogwarts,
I feel more alone than ever.

00:02:50.739 --> 00:02:53.408
I know you, of all people,
will understand.

00:03:27.484 --> 00:03:29.054
Hello, Harry Potter.

00:03:32.322 --> 00:03:35.892
-Your feet. Aren't they cold?
-Bit.

00:03:37.869 --> 00:03:40.645
Unfortunately, all my shoes
have mysteriously disappeared.

00:03:42.457 --> 00:03:45.544
I suspect Nargles are behind it.

00:03:51.883 --> 00:03:54.636
- What are they?
- They're called Thestrals.

00:03:56.221 --> 00:04:00.668
They're quite gentle, really, but people
avoid them because they're a bit....

00:04:04.187 --> 00:04:05.814
Different.

00:04:08.942 --> 00:04:11.029
But why can't the others see them?

00:04:11.486 --> 00:04:14.050
They can only be seen
by people who've seen death.

00:04:17.117 --> 00:04:19.214
So you've known someone
who's died, then?

00:04:19.911 --> 00:04:21.308
My mum.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:27.002
She was quite an extraordinary witch,
but she did like to experiment...

00:04:27.169 --> 00:04:29.814
...and one day,
one of her spells went badly wrong.

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:33.008
-I was 9.
-I'm sorry.

00:04:33.592 --> 00:04:35.062
Yes, it was rather horrible.

00:04:35.969 --> 00:04:41.308
I do feel very sad about it sometimes,
but I've got Dad.

00:04:43.518 --> 00:04:45.040
We both believe you, by the way.

00:04:49.232 --> 00:04:52.235
That He-Who-Must-Not-Be-Named
is back, and you fought him...

00:04:52.622 --> 00:04:55.530
...and the Ministry and the Prophet
are conspiring against you.

00:04:55.697 --> 00:04:59.335
Thanks. It seems you're about
the only ones that do.

00:05:00.202 --> 00:05:01.536
I don't think that's true.

00:05:03.914 --> 00:05:06.462
But I suppose
that's how he wants you to feel.

00:05:07.209 --> 00:05:09.002
What do you mean?

00:05:09.628 --> 00:05:11.505
Well, if I were You-Know-Who...

00:05:11.963 --> 00:05:14.590
...I'd want you to feel cut off
from everyone else...

00:05:15.717 --> 00:05:17.488
...because if it's just you alone...

00:05:19.262 --> 00:05:20.488
...you're not as much of a threat.

00:05:39.241 --> 00:05:43.045
-Do you ever stop eating?
-What? I'm hungry.

00:05:47.374 --> 00:05:48.416
Harry.

00:05:50.252 --> 00:05:51.503
Can I join you?

00:05:53.421 --> 00:05:56.550
Pardon me, professor,
but what exactly are you insinuating?

00:05:56.716 --> 00:05:59.511
McGONAGALL: I am merely requesting
that when it comes to my students...

00:05:59.678 --> 00:06:03.202
...you conform to the prescribed
disciplinary practices.

00:06:04.099 --> 00:06:05.767
So silly of me, but it sounds...

00:06:05.934 --> 00:06:09.333
...as if you're questioning my authority
in my own classroom...

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:11.275
...Minerva.

00:06:11.621 --> 00:06:15.644
Not at all, Dolores,
merely your medieval methods.

00:06:16.444 --> 00:06:18.307
I am sorry, dear.

00:06:19.114 --> 00:06:22.450
But to question my practices
is to question the Ministry...

00:06:22.617 --> 00:06:25.005
...and by extension, the minister himself.

00:06:25.912 --> 00:06:27.027
I am a tolerant woman...

00:06:27.664 --> 00:06:31.582
...but the one thing
I will not stand for is disloyalty.

00:06:34.504 --> 00:06:35.638
Disloyalty.

00:06:38.008 --> 00:06:41.230
Things at Hogwarts
are far worse than I feared.

00:06:42.137 --> 00:06:44.860
Cornelius will want
to take immediate action.

00:06:57.027 --> 00:06:58.945
What's happened to Dumbledore?

00:06:59.112 --> 00:07:01.656
Having already revolutionized...

00:07:01.823 --> 00:07:04.743
...the teaching
of Defense Against the Dark Arts...

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:10.540
...Dolores Umbridge will,
as high inquisitor, have powers...

00:07:11.333 --> 00:07:16.338
...to address the seriously falling
standards at Hogwarts School.

00:07:24.095 --> 00:07:25.664
Just one question, dear.

00:07:26.431 --> 00:07:30.064
You've been in this post
how long, exactly?

00:07:37.442 --> 00:07:41.660
You applied first for the Defense Against
the Dark Arts post, is that correct?

00:07:42.697 --> 00:07:43.849
Yes.

00:07:45.116 --> 00:07:46.724
But you were unsuccessful?

00:07:48.953 --> 00:07:50.372
Obviously.

